    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Billy's Tower, a game about climbing. This is our first game we've made, along with being our first published. In Billy's Tower, your goal is to climb to the moon. You will have to jump from many passing platforms. Along your way you might encounter some obstacles. First, you will see &quot;Evil Billy&quot;. His goal is to either knock you off, or kill you. Next, you'll see a blimp. This blimp will go back and forth hoping to knock you off. After a long time of climbing, you'll reach the end. Do you think you could do it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Billy's Tower, a game about climbing. This is our first game we've made, along with being our first published. In Billy's Tower, your goal is to climb to the moon. You will have to jump from many passing platforms. Along your way you might encounter some obstacles. First, you will see &quot;Evil Billy&quot;. His goal is to either knock you off, or kill you. Next, you'll see a blimp. This blimp will go back and forth hoping to knock you off. After a long time of climbing, you'll reach the end. Do you think you could do it?</p>",
